What is the output of the following C code?
```c
int x = 5;
printf("%d %d %d", x, x<<1, x>>1);
```

What is the output of the following C code?
```c
int a[] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
int *p = a;
printf("%d", *(p + 3));
```

GATE 1991 (Programming & DS - C Programming & Pointers):
What is the output of the following C code?
```c
int a[] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};
int *p = a;
printf("%d", *(p + 3) - *(p + 1));
```

GATE 1994 (Programming & DS - Recursion & Functions):
What value is returned by `foo(4)`?
```c
int foo(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return 1;
    return n + foo(n - 1) + foo(n - 2);
}
```

GATE 1997 (Programming & DS - C Programming & Pointers):
What is printed by the C code?
```c
int x = 5;
printf("%d", x++ * ++x);
```

GATE 2000 (Programming & DS - Recursion & Functions):
How many times is `printf` called when `count(3)` executes?
```c
void count(int n) {
    if (n > 0) {
        printf("*");
        count(n - 1);
        count(n - 1);
    }
}
```

GATE 2003 (Programming & DS - C Programming & Pointers):
What is the output of the C snippet?
```c
char str[] = "GATE2025";
printf("%d", *(str + 4) - '0');
```

GATE 2016 (Programming & DS - C Programming & Pointers):
What is printed by `printf("%d", fun(5))`?
```c
int fun(int n) {
    static int s = 0;
    s += n;
    return s;
}
```

GATE 2019 (Programming & DS - C Programming & Pointers):
What is the output of the following C code?
```c
int a = 10, b = 20;
int *p = &a, *q = &b;
*p = *q;
printf("%d %d", a, b);
```

What is the integer value printed by the following C program?
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int foo(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return 1;
    return foo(n - 1) + 2 * foo(n - 2);
}
int main() {
    printf("%d", foo(4));
    return 0;
}
```

What does the following C code print?
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
    int a[] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6};
    int *p = (int*)(&a + 1);
    printf("%d", *(p - 2));
    return 0;
}
```

GATE 2026 (Q46, Programming & DS - Recursion & Functions):
Consider the function:
```c
int f(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return 1;
    return f(n - 1) + 2 * f(n - 2);
}
```
What is the value of `f(5)`?
